            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1112-f2" n="62" xml:id="d1112-f2-content">
                <p>Spruille Braden, Assistant Secretary of State for American Republic Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1112-f3" n="63" xml:id="d1112-f3-content">
                <p>John A. Loftus, Chief of the Petroleum Division.</p>
            </note>
